# Build output
build/
build-tests/

# Generated language-server database. Produced by `make cdb` from the Makefile's
# own commands, so it is reproducible and would only ever conflict in a diff.
compile_commands.json

# Tool state and caches
.cache/
.kiro/

# Tool state stays out, but the skills under .claude/ are project documentation and
# must survive a clone. The authoritative rules document once lived under .claude/
# and was invisible to everyone who cloned this repo; do not repeat that.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Kept only so a local scratch copy of pre-refactor code cannot be committed by
# accident. No such tree has ever existed in this repository's history -- several
# documents used to claim otherwise; see docs/ai-memory/ref-directory-never-existed.md
ref/

# Editor and OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
